Z||000004||DJRice||11-15-1999||08:43 AM||||It is true, the Camaro, Firebird days will soon be over (for now).  Sales just havent been what they think they should be, so there goes the last of the American RWD Muscle.<P>They did not say that they would be gone for good, but they will be gone for a while.  I believe that the Canadian Plant will be shutting its doors.  Its a shame, but sales have been dropping and Pontiac cant keep selling what people arent buying.<P>They will be back in a couple of years as FWD  4 and 6 cyl rice burner look-a-likes.  Just like the Impala SS.  The 93-96 Impalas were bad to the bone, the new ones might as well be a Nissan or a Mazda.||||reg||1
